# Discord Chat Bridge (DiscordSRV ↔ Website live chatbox)
# 1. Create an app at https://discord.com/developers/applications
# 2. Copy "Application ID" → DISCORD_CLIENT_ID and "Client Secret" → DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET
# 3. Under OAuth2 → Redirects, add: https://YOURSITE/auth/discord/callback (and http://localhost:5173/... for dev)
# 4. The same Bot token (above) needs "View Channel" + "Read Message History" on the DiscordSRV channel
# 5. DISCORD_CHAT_CHANNEL_ID = right-click the DiscordSRV-bridged channel in Discord (Dev Mode on) → Copy Channel ID
# 6. The publishable client ID is exposed to the browser via VITE_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID (safe – client secret stays server-side)
VITE_DISCORD_CLIENT_ID=your-discord-application-id
DISCORD_CLIENT_ID=your-discord-application-id
DISCORD_CLIENT_SECRET=your-discord-client-secret
DISCORD_CHAT_CHANNEL_ID=your-discordsrv-channel-id
# Optional shared secret used by your n8n / Discord webhook relay to POST inbound MC messages
DISCORD_CHAT_INGEST_SECRET=generate-a-long-random-string

